		"0002",	"Coast the motor to a stop without the dynamic brake.",								
	1:		"Overtravel Stopping Method",								
		"0000",	"Apply the dynamic brake or coast the motor to a stop (use the stopping method set in Pn001 = n.oooX).",								
		"0001",	"Decelerate the motor to a stop using the torque set in Pn406 as the maximum torque and then servo-lock the motor.",								
		"0002",	"Decelerate the motor to a stop using the torque set in Pn406 as the maximum torque and then let the motor coast.",								
		"0003",	"Decelerate the motor to a stop using the deceleration time set in Pn30A and then servo-lock the motor.",
		"0004",	"Decelerate the motor to a stop using the deceleration time set in Pn30A and then let the motor coast.",
