		"0000",	"Input AC power as the main circuit power supply using the L1, L2, and L3 terminals (do not use shared converter).",
		"0001",	"Input DC power as the main circuit power supply using the B1/(+) and (-) 2 terminals or the B1 and (-) 2 terminals (use an external converter or the shared converter).",								
